[2026-10-16 13:45:58 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 136]   Tests the plasma-breathing remediation hypothesis for the era
[2026-10-16 13:45:58 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 136]   polarity structure: if the proper-time boundary is screened by
[2026-10-16 13:45:58 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 136]   local heliospheric plasma density, the comet transit structure
[2026-10-16 13:45:58 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 136]   should track the contemporaneous solar-wind dynamic pressure at
[2026-10-16 13:45:58 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 136]   each perihelion epoch.  Solar Cycle 24 peaked in 2014 and declined
[2026-10-16 13:45:58 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 136]   through the 2018-2021 minimum -- the same window in which the
[2026-10-16 13:45:58 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 136]   declared/displaced polarity transition sits (step 130).
[2026-10-16 13:45:58 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 136]   Data: NASA/GSFC OMNIWeb COHO daily merged dataset
[2026-10-16 13:45:58 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 136]   (omni_m_daily.dat), provenance-pinned into data/raw/omni/.
[2026-10-16 13:45:58 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 136]   Dynamic pressure P_dyn = m_p * n * v^2 in nPa, monthly averaged.
[2026-10-16 13:45:58 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 136]   T1  Pooled per-comet residual ~ P_dyn Spearman correlation.
[2026-10-16 13:45:58 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 136]   T2  Within-era decomposition of the apex-side shell-band
