[2026-10-16 13:45:58 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 136]   correlation is only the era contrast restated, within-era
[2026-10-16 13:45:58 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 136]   coupling vanishes.
[2026-10-16 13:45:58 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 136]   T3  Era P_dyn contrast -- documents the confound directly:
[2026-10-16 13:45:58 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 136]   post-2017 perihelia sample the cycle-24 decline/minimum.
[2026-10-16 13:45:58 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 136]   T4  Regime-split axis test: dipole polarity of the residual
[2026-10-16 13:45:58 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 136]   field about the bipolar axis in high- versus low-pressure
